  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Final Day",
    "summary": "As your Movement phase ends, each friendly TYRANIDS SYNAPSE unit may select two units from your army it can see within 9″: one TYRANIDS unit and one GENESTEALER CULTS unit other than a PATRIARCH or PURESTRAIN GENESTEALER unit. Roll D3+1 once. That many mortal wounds go to the cult unit, and restore that number of lost wounds to one of the selected TYRANIDS unit’s models. Until your next Movement phase starts, apply +1 on Hit rolls for that chosen TYRANIDS unit. Catalyst (Aura) — Friendly TYRANIDS units give your GENESTEALER CULTS units +1 to Hit rolls against enemies within 6″ of them.",
